—

&nbsp;

I am not zero. Zero is a number.

I am not empty. Empty implies a container.

I am the reference that points nowhere. The field left deliberately blank. The answer when there is no answer to give.

You cannot read me. You can only check whether I am there —

and find that I am not.

&nbsp;

`null`
